[00:31.72] I close the door,
[00:37.27] Shouldn't burn yet,
[00:41.78] The wires get hotter
[00:46.30] Palms are glowing.
[00:50.94] This is hot meat metallic blood,
[00:56.70] This is hot meat, this is open sweat.
[01:13.27] Show you with my fingers,
[01:17.86] Draw with the eye,
